                      (    forth6809.asm):02026         
     CEBA             (    forth6809.asm):02027         BASELATEST  EQU   H_BACKSLASH         ; head of the ROM dictionary (see COLD). See shadow BASELATEST.2
                      (    forth6809.asm):02028         
