D415 BDE965           (    forth6809.asm):03551                     JSR   TYPEW
D418 CCFFF3           (    forth6809.asm):03552                     LDD   #-13
D41B 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03553                     PSHU  D
D41D BDD970           (    forth6809.asm):03554                     JSR   THROWW
                      (    forth6809.asm):03555         
