D754 3D               (    forth6809.asm):04170                     MUL
D755 EBE4             (    forth6809.asm):04171                     ADDB  ,S
D757 2401             (    forth6809.asm):04172                     BCC   UM1
D759 4C               (    forth6809.asm):04173                     INCA
