DEFB 3606             (    forth6809.asm):05694                     PSHU  D
DEFD 39               (    forth6809.asm):05695         QDUPDONE:   RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):05696         
                      (    forth6809.asm):05697         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
                      (    forth6809.asm):05698         ; DEPTH  ( -- +n )
